Affects everything, really.

1649
01:30:52,981 --> 01:30:56,101
- Oh, really?
- So it's not an easy, simple disease.

1650
01:30:57,261 --> 01:30:58,861
- But don't be anxious.
- Mm-hmm.

1651
01:30:58,941 --> 01:31:01,741
Everything we talked about is reversible.

1652
01:31:01,821 --> 01:31:02,901
Oh, really?

1653
01:31:03,421 --> 01:31:06,421
